{"step_index":105,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T02:26:15Z","thinking":"**Examining Desktop Files**\n\nI'm now investigating the files on the Desktop, specifically looking for contact information within them. I'm starting with '배현명_실사DB_네이버지도_카카오맵_전화번호검증리포트. I am now proceeding with my review of the files.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Check past phone verification files on Desktop","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\n\nfunction parseCSVLine(text) {\n  const result = [];\n  let cur = '';\n  let inQuotes = false;\n  for (let i = 0; i < text.length; i++) {\n    const char = text[i];\n    if (char === '\"') {\n      if (inQuotes && text[i + 1] === '\"') {\n        cur += '\"';\n        i++;\n      } else {\n        inQuotes = !inQuotes;\n      }\n    } else if (char === ',' && !inQuotes) {\n      result.push(cur);\n      cur = '';\n    } else {\n      cur += char;\n    }\n  }\n  result.push(cur);\n  return result;\n}\n\nconst mapFiles = [\n  'C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\Desktop\\\\오늘\\\\배현명_실사DB_네이버지도_카카오맵_전화번호검증리포트.csv',\n  'C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\Desktop\\\\오늘\\\\배현명_실사DB_전화실사_통화검증_콜시트.csv',\n  'C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\Desktop\\\\오늘\\\\배현명_실사DB_18컬럼_최종검증완료.csv',\n  'C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\Desktop\\\\오늘\\\\배현명_실사DB_검증완료_최신.csv'\n];\n\nmapFiles.forEach(f => {\n  if (fs.existsSync(f)) {\n    const lines = fs.readFileSync(f, 'utf8').split(/\\r?\\n/).filter(l => l.trim());\n    console.log(`\\nFile: ${f}`);\n    console.log(`  Lines: ${lines.length}`);\n    console.log(`  Header: ${lines[0]}`);\n    if (lines.length > 1) {\n      console.log(`  Sample 1: ${lines[1]}`);\n    }\n  } else {\n    console.log(`File NOT found: ${f}`);\n  }\n});\n","Description":"Inspect past map and call sheet files","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\a175f348-8ff3-4533-941e-7ffa2cc72c0b\\scratch\\inspect_past_cont